Linear Regression:(output is numerical value)
linear regression is an algorithm used too find the relationship between input variable x &  outpit variable y 
model find one line betweenx,y
Formula: y = ax +b: Score = a x study hours +b    studyhours (feature), score (target)
we have 2 main method: model.fit(x_train, y_train):teach to mode with training ,model.predict(x_test) for predicting new value
