KNN:(K-Nearest neighbors)
the model finds the Nearest data points that have a class.
its mainly used for classification problems .its a supervised algorithm 
Example : Classifying an email as spam or not smap.
COde: from sklearn.neighbors import KNeighborsClassifier
model.fit(x_train, y_train)
prediction = model.predict(x_test)
